  Title: '<color=#FFA14E>Thanksgiving Scavenger Hunt</color>'
  Details: '<color=white>We’re kicking off the Thanksgiving Scavenger Hunt this week and it will run until 12/2.\n\nThere are 10 items hidden throughout the game during the event! Find them all and claim a FREE accessory!</color>\n\nHere are some hints to get you started:\n\n<color=white>-Rob a bank while dressed as an old lady\n\n-Give an orphan a home\n\n-Give someone an atomic wedgie</color>'
